'_', '-') only replaces the first underscore - if an admin model type contains multiple underscores, it won't match ADMIN_MODELS and will incorrectly use the non-admin base path - should use a global replacement to normalize all underscores": 0.8735354542732239, "Typo in the describe block title: 'emeddable' should be 'embeddable'": 0.10513734072446823}